      "target_level": 2,
      "priority": "Medium",
      "active": true,
      "reason": "Knowledge-only measures. ICB4 conditions the KCI on the project being part of a programme, which is rare at KIB. Retained because the knowledge supports upward interfacing, but it is awareness-level, not a delivery capability.",
